Output docs/media/hero.gif

Set Shell "bash"
Set FontFamily "JetBrainsMono Nerd Font"
Set FontSize 16
Set Width 1200
Set Height 700
Set Padding 20
Set Framerate 24

Hide
Type "zellij -s dotfiles --detached" Enter
Type "zellij -s despesas --detached" Enter
Type "luneta luneta" Enter
Sleep 3s
Show

Sleep 1s

Ctrl+j
Sleep 2s

Down@600ms 3
Sleep 2s

Type@200ms "dot"
Sleep 2s
Enter
Sleep 3s

Hide
Ctrl+o
Type "d"
Sleep 500ms
Type "zellij delete-all-sessions --yes --force" Enter
Sleep 1s
